Subject: [PATCH] YT3-850F: notification indicator + running-text ticker in the top bar

Shows the newest notification's app icon and text next to Wi-Fi/Bluetooth,
also on the lock screen. Long text runs like a banner, looping, until the
notification is cleared; then the next newest one is shown.
Strip width adapts: 220px landscape, 140px portrait.
---
--- a/src/top-panel.c	2026-11-20 00:03:54.834879609 +0200
+++ b/src/top-panel.c	2026-11-20 08:47:46.657086231 +0200
@@ -18,6 +18,9 @@
 
